{"id": 34, "name": "Estes", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/c/c0/Hero341-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141430", "cls": ["Support", ""], "specialty": ["Regen", "Guard"], "difficulty": "30", "stats": ["70", "10", "20", "30"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "Elf King who rules the Moon Elves.", "skills": [{"name": "Scripture of the Moon Elf", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0eb30f512750394ac949651d801d92f0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scripture of the Moon Elf</span> slowly charges energy for Estes. Upon reaching 100 stacks, it enhances his next Basic Attack, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the target. The attack will ricochet to nearby enemies, dealing 125<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+75% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slowing them by 60% for 1.5s."}, {"name": "Moonlight Immersion", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f5b04cea7f95a5fd378699c764f39384.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Estes recovers 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+110% Total Magic Power)</span> HP for the target allied hero immediately and links himself with them for 5s. While linked, both heroes gain 15 Hybrid Defense, and the target slowly recovers 360<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+90% Total Magic Power)</span> HP. Linking with an allied hero increases Estes' Movement Speed by 15%, as well as the energy charging speed of the Scripture of the Moon Elf.\n\nBeing too far from the target will break the link."}, {"name": "Domain of Moon Goddess", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_207a8204b952f50031ad3ca3c6abea42.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Estes drops a flood of moonlight on the target area, dealing 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+70% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemy units within it. Afterwards, it turns to a domain of the Moon Goddess and reveals enemies inside it. Enemies will be slowed by 90% for 1.5s if they touch the edge of the domain area. (The slow effect will decay over time.)"}, {"name": "Blessing of Moon Goddess", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0bc801eaf911ceb696997fbe43105440.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 55   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Estes casts an enhanced <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Moonlight Immersion</span> on himself and all nearby allied heroes, refreshing <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Moonlight Immersion</span> on them and enhancing it for 8s.\n\nEnhanced <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Moonlight Immersion</span>: Doubles the Instant Basic Healing and Hybrid Defense Increase, and heals the target for 1020<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+225% Total Magic Power)</span> HP over time."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Demon Boots - Favor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ca2a5c2be6010eb0ecff954a27bf05db.png"}, {"name": "Flask of the Oasis", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bd4250e426ca1cf5e7f8a7b0861ad4b1.png"}, {"name": "Fleeting Time", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_1bc292932